    {
      "id": "evidence-001-notes",
      "kind": {
        "text": "`theorem_axiom_footprint` reports `nat Nat.exists_prime_gt 0` and `integer Nat.exists_prime_gt 0`. `nat_axiom_inventory` bounds it by enumerating the whole trusted surface: a theorem cannot depend on a trusted declaration the environment does not contain. Counting `Declaration::Axiom` alone would not suffice -- `Opaque` has no proof body and `Quotient` admits `Quot.sound` -- so all three kinds are covered.",
